  "text": " I dreamt this morning that I start talking to this dad in a children's play setting of some sort. And I get his number and I call him. And I only want to make friends with him, but I snap at him. I snap at him and I immediately regret it. And it takes it really badly. I was trying to tell him that I didn't mean it that way. It's not what I meant, but it's too late. And he hangs up on me and I feel awful. And then I call you and you play me some music and we laugh.",
